    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if waiting for the regime to actually rise leads to widespread genocide or mass human rights violations? isnt it more immoral to watch something like that happen from the sidelines when you have the power to stop it before it starts? doesn't the \"protection of human rights\" you mentioned actually demand some kind of action?",
